This is an independent list of the best SEO companies in the UK, ranked by methodology, published results and specialisation, not paid placements. I am an independent SEO consultant based in London and Reading, Berkshire, with no financial relationship with any agency listed. I am included myself, transparently labelled, so you can compare my approach against theirs.

Most "best SEO agency" lists charge £500-£5,000 for a featured spot, so the companies on those lists paid to be there. This one does not work that way.

**Selection criteria:** verifiable case studies, publicly demonstrated methodology, client retention evidence, specialist depth or breadth of capability, and fit across different business types and budgets.

